        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="T1" value="&lt;b&gt;tts.js — feedTTS(delta)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;sentences.js splits on whole sentences; each is spoken as soon as it is complete&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• browser speechSynthesis, or XTTS via POST /api/tts (the fetch chain runs one sentence AHEAD of playback)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• stops dictation first — feedback guard&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• noteSpoken(text) — echo guard for barge-in&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• ttsPending++ → syncOrb() = &quot;speaking&quot;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1140" y="170" width="290" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="T2" value="&lt;b&gt;flushTTS() on &lt;i&gt;done&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;the last partial sentence is spoken&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;ttsPending hits 0 → onAllSpeechDone()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;→ maybeResumeVoiceLoop() after 400 ms&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
